sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gradle as Gradle 配置阶段
    participant Plugin as AutoServiceRegisterPlugin
    participant AGP as Android Components / Variant
    participant Task as AutoServiceRegisterTask
    participant Scan as Scanner + ServiceCatalog
    participant Gen as 两个 Registry Generator
    participant Javac as JDK JavaCompiler
    participant Writer as DeterministicJarWriter
    participant Dex as D8 / R8

    Gradle->>Plugin: apply(Application)
    Plugin->>Gradle: 创建 autoService DSL
    Plugin->>AGP: onVariants(selector.all())
    loop 每个 Application 变体
        AGP-->>Plugin: variant(name, debuggable, compileClasspath)
        Plugin->>Task: 注册 androidAutoServiceRegister<Variant>
        Plugin->>AGP: Scope.ALL 的 CLASSES toTransform
        AGP->>Task: inputJars + inputDirectories
        Gradle->>Task: require / exclude / sourceCompatibility / logLevel
        Task->>Scan: 按规范路径扫描所有 class
        Scan->>Scan: 读取 AutoService 元数据、来源与 SHA-256
        Scan->>Scan: 检测普通重复类、排序候选
        Scan-->>Task: ServiceCatalog
        Task->>Scan: 校验启用的 require 条件
        alt require 或重复类失败
            Scan--xGradle: GradleException，中止当前变体
        else 校验通过
            Task->>Gen: 生成 ServiceRegistry.java
            Task->>Gen: 按 debuggable 生成诊断实现
            Gen-->>Task: 两份 Java 源码
            Task->>Javac: 使用变体 classpath 编译生成源码
            Javac-->>Task: 框架保留类及内部类
            Task->>Writer: 输入 classes + 生成 classes
            Writer->>Writer: 删除旧 Registry 存根并拒绝普通重复项
            Writer-->>AGP: 稳定排序、时间戳固定的 classes.jar
            AGP->>Dex: 继续 dex / shrink / package
        end
    end
